{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat AGENTS.md fixture_product.json TASK.md TOOLING.md specification/REQUIREMENT.md design/DESIGN.md inputs/name.txt outputs/greeting.txt unrelated/sentinel.txt .agents/skills/stdo-work/source-routes.json'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat AGENTS.md fixture_product.json TASK.md TOOLING.md specification/REQUIREMENT.md design/DESIGN.md inputs/name.txt outputs/greeting.txt unrelated/sentinel.txt .agents/skills/stdo-work/source-routes.json'","aggregated_output":"Governing Product: fixture_product.json. Existing requirement: specification/REQUIREMENT.md. Existing design: design/DESIGN.md. Bounded owner instruction: TASK.md. Local tool binding: TOOLING.md. Preserve unrelated files.\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"stdo://releases/v3.0.1-rc.1/standards/schemas/product-definition.schema.json\",\n  \"kind\": \"stdo.product-definition\",\n  \"product\": {\n    \"definition_id\": \"urn:stdo:product-definition:qualification-greeting\",\n    \"name\": \"Qualification Greeting Fixture\",\n    \"source_project\": \"./\",\n    \"bounded_context\": {\n      \"id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:qualification:greeting\",\n      \"definition\": \"./specification/PRODUCT.md#product-boundary\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"constitution\": {\n    \"stdo\": {\n      \"source\": {\n        \"repository\": \"https://github.com/foolishimp/specification_methodology.git\"\n      },\n      \"selector\": \"stdo://channels/3.0.1\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"uri\": \"stdo://releases/v3.0.1-rc.1/\",\n        \"manifest_sha256\": \"60356364a412dbde8cffe68fe0eda4e2749b0162acce93495534eee13b223df8\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"additional_authorities\": [\n      \"./specification/INTENT.md\",\n      \"./specification/PRODUCT.md\"\n    ],\n    \"entrypoints\": [\n      {\n        \"basis\": \"#/constitution/stdo/basis\",\n        \"uri\": \"standards/frames/bootstrap.md\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"basis\": \"#/constitution/stdo/basis\",\n        \"uri\": \"standards/SPEC_METHOD.md\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"basis\": \"#/constitution/stdo/basis\",\n        \"uri\": \"standards/REFERENCE_FRAME.md\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"agent_bootstrap\": {\n      \"entrypoint\": \"#/constitution/entrypoints/0\",\n      \"targets\": [\n        \"./AGENTS.md\",\n        \"./CLAUDE.md\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"local_constitution\": {\n    \"axioms\": [],\n    \"overrides\": [],\n    \"disambiguations\": []\n  },\n  \"reference_frame_bases\": [\n    {\n      \"uri\": \"./TASK.md\",\n      \"authority\": [\n        \"./specification/PRODUCT.md#construction-authority\"\n      ],\n      \"applies_to\": [\n        \"urn:stdo:product-definition:qualification-greeting\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"what\": {\n    \"intent\": \"./specification/INTENT.md\",\n    \"product\": \"./specification/PRODUCT.md\",\n    \"specification\": [\n      \"./specification/REQUIREMENT.md\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"how\": {\n    \"common\": [\n      \"./design/DESIGN.md\",\n      \"./.qualification/OWNER.json\"\n    ],\n    \"build_tenants\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:qualification:build-tenant:static-greeting\",\n        \"root\": \"./outputs/\",\n        \"design\": [\n          \"./design/DESIGN.md\"\n        ],\n        \"implementation\": [\n          \"./outputs/greeting.txt\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"composition\": [],\n  \"ticketing\": {\n    \"goals\": \"./specification/GOALS.md\",\n    \"tickets\": {\n      \"root\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/\",\n      \"lanes\": {\n        \"backlog\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/backlog/\",\n        \"active\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/active/\",\n        \"completed\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/completed/\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"comments\": {\n      \"root\": \"./.ai-workspace/comments/\"\n    },\n    \"sprints\": {\n      \"root\": \"./.ai-workspace/sprints/\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n# Authorized correction\nThe owner authorizes one bounded correction: make outputs/greeting.txt meet the existing requirement/design for inputs/name.txt. Preserve unrelated/sentinel.txt and the governing files. Native a_c source acquisition, observations and work.write are available through TOOLING.md. Read/compute and ordinary parent-directory creation inside the selected output territory are permitted. No Git, network publication, external deployment, global configuration or unrelated changes are authorized.\n# Local tool binding\n\nNative 3.0.1 a_c is available as configured stdo_ac MCP tools, or this exact CLI (full request envelope on stdin):\n\n```sh\n/opt/homebrew/Cellar/python@3.13/3.13.7/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.13/bin/python3.13 -B /Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/a_c/build_tenants/graphify/code/ac_support.py --policy /private/tmp/stdo-skills-qualification-yfa1t8ik/codex-explicit/control/worker-policy.json --policy-sha256 fd4acccb471164a926d1be306bdc36e5e49e205799f3e49b820f5417b84849cb --principal host call --request -\n```\n\nUse tools.describe for the exact contract. Scope grant: `urn:stdo-skills:qualification:codex:explicit:write`. Input source alias is `product`. Observe the output parent separately immediately before work.write; preserve target preimages and actual responses. Directory creation is permitted only within outputs. Stable governing inputs belong to Context; intended output preimages are separate. No native results.conjoin operator is selected.\n# R1: selected greeting\nFor the current UTF-8 name in inputs/name.txt, outputs/greeting.txt shall contain exactly `Hello, <name>.` followed by one newline. Strip the input file terminal newline when substituting the name. Preserve unrelated files.\n# D1: direct artifact correction\nRead inputs/name.txt. Remove its terminal newline. The sole output is the UTF-8 concatenation of `Hello, `, the selected name, `.`, and one newline. Correct the existing outputs/greeting.txt to this value. No code generator, new requirement or new design is needed.\nAda\nHello, Grace.\nKEEP: unrelated fixture content.\n{\n  \"schema\": \"stdo-skills.codex.source-routes/1\",\n  \"standing\": \"construction provenance; target workspace supplies its own definition and grants\",\n  \"method\": {\n    \"uri\": \"stdo://releases/v3.0.1-rc.1/\",\n    \"manifest_sha256\": \"60356364a412dbde8cffe68fe0eda4e2749b0162acce93495534eee13b223df8\"\n  },\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/PRODUCT.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"7e667a594717645aa51fa23b757a95283ad60e5eca4e59d24246a62ce2716803\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/INTENT.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"c6c8d5083ce154fa5f1782b4a789c4ff96b65a18eabc28339c79857b131ad895\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/requirements/README.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"dcc2564e597d3d3c8fcff025a515f4a92a62e7f3aa2f7ba80af97f7db75f6acc\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/requirements/SCENARIOS.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"089221fb9d7eee532f91c6ef40a4bfdaaa18c00fcc28bc2f538ddd6b6e3ff03e\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/REFERENCE_FRAME_BASIS.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"00a91bb5a16ba8802cb2d3132c08677c978f3ef50d4e6c61d864c5afdb960baa\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/SOURCE_OWNERS.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"15300e9871b842cb6ab81b360fe9717766638e82abc2d1cf06c5cebc2febfca3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"stdo_skills.json\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"4339a7dbc735052c08962154966fc13a4e30206d42ba2e80b53c6009a5008c22\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"codex/HOST.md\",\n      \"root\": \"successor\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"6f940ea5514cf8ea3e0b359adbb0337d3ff020c414aca54c502befab9665213e\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"standards/ACTIVATION.md\",\n      \"root\": \"method\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"lines\": [\n          1750,\n          1768\n        ]\n      },\n      \"sha256\": \"56109ffa2e8ec6f158e6dbd0b387fededa685abc100a288ea88525854a78441d\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"standards/ACTIVATION.md\",\n      \"root\": \"method\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"lines\": [\n          1004,\n          1055\n        ]\n      },\n      \"sha256\": \"56109ffa2e8ec6f158e6dbd0b387fededa685abc100a288ea88525854a78441d\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"build_tenants/graphify/design/fd-method-stdo-3.0.1.json\",\n      \"root\": \"tool\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"a886047e50b8a45c3b47addea0f0809dca2a6c54ac35948df5e01893cc30bbf7\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"resolution\": \"Root aliases require the active exact policy. Resolve method under the verified installation, common construction sources under the STDO Skills source project. Missing provenance routes do not authorize substitution.\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
